nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UZcuVm5pXXQQ7kNvwHnPt0U&_nc_oc=AdqNX4FzULeX34ZD96E2qbXC3hPpQqvf1yL23i7id3r7dmrMf5t_mseXwX0z1CKXNqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMeMrd0aKqOHYPa5qIcTlNhQBNr7GX7sjUUfm84Pmq2jA&oe=6AC3AB59"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "StoreCover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1511443186749788", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618251_1511443190083121_6071622312822294156_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KWEFr8nXzmUQ7kNvwHlpg9l&_nc_oc=AdpMPZ7fS-wJz4ALEQugxCUJJJU39T0BAsTJjGNW7hZMlMKLsIDVrPyOvEiPeHwsU5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOfxUodKbY_0gGE8UeQtLZ75DS6errQbxnlcc5f7QahUw&oe=6AC3C482"}, "display_name": "Deadeye Saloon", "keywords": ["party"], "long_description": "# Deadeye Saloon (Beta)\n\nWelcome to **Deadeye Saloon**, a simple and playful VR showdown you can enjoy **with no controllers, no movement, and no hassle.** Just sit back, raise your hands, and let your gestures decide the duel.\nIn this saloon, victory comes from **recognizing matching card pairs.** See a pair? **Quickly form the right hand gesture** to strike first and outplay your opponent. Fast reads and fast hands win the round.\nDesigned for pure comfort, you can play **seated**, in your most relaxed spot, using only your headset and your hands.\nDeadeye Saloon is currently in **Beta**, with more rules, items, and modes on the way. Jump in now for lighthearted duels\u2014and stay tuned as the saloon grows with future updates.", "short_description": "Deadeye Saloon is a fast multiplayer VR party game built entirely on hand gestures.\nAll players draw and reveal cards simultaneously. When a matching gesture card pair appears, performing the correct gesture activates powerful abilities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1siPztmxhlIPsCskr2MIo3liJmgP1yFzLwWF-qobSDSg", "dev